{"id":"4b36bbcc43ee4b848f072f518dd50742","model":"gpt-oss-120b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"answer\": \"The Rescuers was released earlier.\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    [\"The Rescuers Down Under\", 1],\n    [\"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", 0]\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to answer: Which Walt Disney film was released earlier, The Rescuers or The Muppets? Use evidence.\n\nWe have evidence about The Rescuers Down Under (1990) but not The Rescuers (1977). However The Rescuers Down Under is a sequel, but the question asks about The Rescuers (original 1977) vs The Muppets (film 2011). We need release dates.\n\nWe have evidence: The Rescuers Down Under released November 16, 1990. That's not The Rescuers. No direct evidence for The Rescuers release year. But we have that The Rescuers Down Under is sequel to 1977 animated film \"The Rescuers\". That indicates The Rescuers was 1977. Sentence: \"the film is the sequel to the 1977 animated film \\\"The Rescuers\\\"\". So we have year 1977 for The Rescuers. That's evidence.\n\nWe also have The Muppets soundtrack released November 22, 2011 for the musical comedy film \"The Muppets\". That indicates The Muppets film released 2011 (though not explicit, but soundtrack release date suggests film around that time). We can use that as evidence that The Muppets film is later than 1977.\n\nThus answer: The Rescuers was released earlier.\n\nProvide citations: The Rescuers Down Under sentence showing 1977 original film. That's title \"The Rescuers Down Under\", sentence_id 1. And The Muppets soundtrack sentence showing release November 22, 2011. That's title \"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", sentence_id 0.\n\nReturn JSON with answer and citations.\n\n"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1994,"completion_tokens":415,"total_tokens":2409,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791994783,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}